1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,796
Lay a seedling on its side.

2
00:00:01,796 --> 00:00:10,260
Gravity is sensed by starch-filled amyloplasts, called statoliths, that settle to the bottom of cells in the root cap.

3
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:14,869
Auxin then collects on the lower side, of the root and of the shoot alike.

